1055
00:58:43,300 --> 00:58:45,620
结果两次都把屁股摔得死去活来。
On both occasions I died on my arse.

1056
00:58:47,060 --> 00:58:49,780
“我也一想到晚宴演讲就发抖，
'I too trembled at the thought
of after-dinner speaking,

1057
00:58:49,780 --> 00:58:52,340
而且还有别的事儿。”
'and I had another issue.'

1058
