but the mighty Vauxhall Vectra
engine is working well.

1065
00:59:22,100 --> 00:59:24,620
来吧，抓地力十足的“小鸡鸡”轮子。
Come on, grippy penis wheels.

1066
00:59:24,660 --> 00:59:29,900
“在 Pinin，我对乡村土法的无知
