Minimal revs, just let the torque
do it.

1076
00:59:58,860 --> 01:00:01,980
这就是杰里米
要大跌眼镜的地方。
This is where Jeremy's going to go
horribly wrong.

1077
01:00:01,980 --> 01:00:04,940
动力并不一定是
